# Local materialization of `skills.toml` — machine-specific links/copies.
# The manifest (`skills.toml`) is commit-safe (skill names only).
# These dests are recreated on each machine with `skl use --all`.
#
# Do not force-add these to a repo's .gitignore without asking.
# Copy the lines you want, or:
#   cat examples/skills.gitignore >> .gitignore

.agents/skills/
.claude/skills/
